{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"streaming-tts","title":"流式语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/streaming-tts","wordCount":972,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"voice-cloning","title":"声音克隆与定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/voice-cloning","wordCount":1210,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标与质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/evaluation-metrics","wordCount":1116,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 工程实践\n\n将论文中的 TTS 模型变成可用的产品，需要解决三组工程问题：如何让合成语音「边说边出」以满足实时交互需求（流式合成）、如何用极少样本复刻任意说话人的音色（声音克隆）、以及如何客观而可靠地度量合成质量（评估指标）。\n\n本章三篇文档聚焦从研究到生产的关键桥梁——不是更多的模型创新，而是让创新真正可部署、可衡量、可信赖的工程纪律。\n"}